  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p>The tools you trust - now more reliable than ever<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>The System 8 family was developed by working closely with orthopaedic surgeons and the hospital staff to deliver solutions to the complex challenges of today’s healthcare environment.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "Dilara.Atkins@stryker.com",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 11 2017 15:47:20 GMT-0400",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
    "textIsRich": [
      "true",
      "true",
      "true"
    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Improved ergonomics give surgeons a better, neutral wrist&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">position, and textured areas help provide a firmer grip</span></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>A&nbsp;quick and efficient keyless drill chuck prevents loosening&nbsp;through a secondary locking mechanism, and advanced&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">material and coating on pin collets prevent sticking&nbsp;and slipping, both of which are common concerns</span></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The&nbsp;handpieces are built to be actively washed – able to be&nbsp;temporarily submerged when you need to do so during&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">cleaning, prior to sterilization</span></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
